   "key": "formula",
   "quote": "I am hoping we will get the override and limp through a few years and that the Chapter 70 formula changes",
   "town": "https://www.lunenburgma.gov/AgendaCenter/ViewFile/Minutes/_04012026-7748",
   "why": "The formula is the thing the town is waiting on, and it is decided at the State House."
  },
  {
